WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.773
EXTRACT reads one component from a date or timestamp
You can extract

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:11.492
year month day of week hour and many other fields
The result

00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:17.438
is a component value not a new grouped timestamp
This distinction matters

00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:20.123
when comparing EXTRACT with DATE_TRUNC
